This project is a website for the Roblox game "Divine Rarities"
The website is projected to have 3 mains parts: the wiki, calculators, and guides

The website is hosted on github pages (with auto deploy thanks to github workflows)
In the dev environment, it is built using vite (npm run dev)

All code is javascript, no typescript

The website's structure is projected to be:
[Name, eventually logo of website] [version]
[Tabs]
L> Wiki, Calculators, Guides
[Footer]